					<description><![CDATA[<p>You&#039;re staring at a queue that won&#039;t clear. Your best agents are answering the same password, order status and refund questions for the tenth time today, while a furious customer with a complicated billing dispute has been on hold for twenty minutes. Your board wants you to cut cost per contact. Your customers want an [&#8230;]</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://yellow.ai/conversational/ai-customer-service/">AI Customer Service: Technologies, KPIs and Roadmap</a> appeared first on <a href="https://yellow.ai">Yellow.ai</a>.</p>
